css-0"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C;text-wrap:pretty">It takes a lot to wear Major V down thanks to its <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">rugged design</strong>. These headphones are also <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">foldable</strong> so that you can easily pack them away and be gone for days.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="css-3lf2mu"><div class="css-1b1a8p0"><div class="css-hl0vi5"><div class="css-n3mk9x"><div class="css-tecz51"><picture class="css-y6dvqs"><source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) and (min-width: 1281px)" type="image/png" sizes="100vw" width="16" height="9" alt="Folded Marshall Major V Black on-ear headphones." srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/2NPABmGcJp6aUhJqX83XcX/afc08e374086f46a1e442c00e5416eb2/major-v-single-asset-desktop-06.gif?w=1200&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 1200w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/2NPABmGcJp6aUhJqX83XcX/afc08e374086f46a1e442c00e5416eb2/major-v-single-asset-desktop-06.gif?w=1500&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 1500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/2NPABmGcJp6aUhJqX83XcX/afc08e374086f46a1e442c00e5416eb2/major-v-single-asset-desktop-06.gif?w=1900&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 1900w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/2NPABmGcJp6aUhJqX83XcX/afc08e374086f46a1e442c00e5416eb2/major-v-single-asset-desktop-06.gif?w=2400&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 2400w"/><source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" type="image/png" sizes="100vw" width="4" height="5" alt="Folded Marshall Major V Black on-ear headphones." srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=300&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 300w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=500&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=700&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 700w, //images.ctfasse