h/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=1500&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 1500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=1900&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 1900w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/3CVMNlO1I27hXtFXqqfi6Y/f9d796e554135aac507e6fffd5b17c60/major-v-single-asset-mobile-06.gif?w=2400&amp;fm=png&amp;fl=png8 2400w" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto"/></picture><button title="Pause button" class="css-1mmai13"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-ua7cne"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4 1.5h1.5v13H4zM10.5 1.5H12v13h-1.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="two-assets-widget css-1hdfdjo"><div class="shared-top css-1stqjnx"><div class="css-bz60ct"><h3 class="chakra-text css-z6ujzh" style="text-wrap:pretty">Customisable M-Button</h3><div class="css-1situk"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C;text-wrap:pretty">Instantly access your favourite features thanks to Major V’s <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">M-button </strong>and the <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">Marshall Bluetooth app</strong>. Just press the M-script logo to open the<strong style="color:#FFFFFF"> Spotify Tap</strong> default function, your <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">EQ settings </strong>or <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">voice assistant</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="css-t5098a"><div class="css-ypv6sy"><div class="css-1osdkjd"><picture class="css-y6dvqs"><source media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/png" sizes="100vw" width="4" height="5" alt="Woman with Marshall Major V Black on-ear headphones against a red textured background." srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/2QugHldutuuVvZlbzk3rIV/11dbe48ad0e49d573d8a4591fdf