FFFFF">EQ settings </strong>or <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">voice assistant</strong>.</p></div></div></div><div class="css-od5bpv"><picture class="css-6n7m1r"><source type="image/avif" sizes="auto, 100vw" media="(min-width: 768px)" width="4" height="3" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 640w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=1024&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 1024w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=1440&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 1440w"/><source type="image/jpeg" sizes="auto, 100vw" media="(min-width: 768px)" width="4" height="3" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 640w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=1024&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1024w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=1440&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1440w"/><source type="image/avif" sizes="auto, 100vw" width="4" height="3" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=320&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 320w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=480&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 480w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 640w"/><source type="image/jpeg" sizes="auto, 100vw" width="4" height="3" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=320&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 320w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=480&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 480w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 640w"/><img style="height:100%;width:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover;opacity:1;object-position:center" alt="Close-up image showing M-button on Marshall Major V Black on-ear headphones." width="4" height="3" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=320&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 320w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=480&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 480w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/33Gl1cbcBL7RFN40onP7pE/4add662275447b417b76526d0dc3e2c4/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-08.jpeg?w=640&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 640w" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto"/></picture></div></div></div><div class="two-assets-widget css-3m0du1"><div class="shared-top css-1stqjnx"><div class="css-y7e74b"><h3 class="chakra-text css-z6ujzh" style="text-wrap:pretty">Wireless charging</h3><div class="css-1situk"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C;text-wrap:pretty"><strong style="color:#FFFFFF">Wireless charging</strong> means it’s simple to give Major V a boost when needed. Just rest your headphones on a charging pad and you’re good to go. Major V can also be recharged using a <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">USB-C charging cable </strong>included in the box.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="css-1blduqi"><div class="css-h3legs"><h3 class="chakra-text css-z6ujzh" style="text-wrap:pretty">Wireless charging</h3><div class="css-1situk"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C;text-wrap:pretty"><strong style="color:#FFFFFF">Wireless charging</strong> means it’s simple to give Major V a boost when needed. Just rest your headphones on a charging pad and you’re good to go. Major V can also be recharged using a <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">USB-C charging cable </strong>included in the box.</p></div></div></div><div class="css-ypv6sy"><picture class="css-1ij43gw"><source type="image/avif" sizes="auto, 100vw" media="(min-width: 768px)" width="1" height="1" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=640&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 640w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=1024&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 1024w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=1440&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 1440w"/><source type="image/png" sizes="auto, 100vw" media="(min-width: 768px)" width="1" height="1" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=640&amp;fm=png 640w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=1024&amp;fm=png 1024w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=1440&amp;fm=png 1440w"/><source type="image/avif" sizes="auto, 100vw" width="1" height="1" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=320&amp;fm=avif&amp;q=100 320w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/6IBaoHeWCvmZZ1KgQkuqwQ/18430829c3ea56dab5a72c05a0267f94/major-v-two-asset-hybrid-09.png?w=480&