37/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1200w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1500&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1900&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1900w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=2400&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 2400w"/><img style="height:100%;width:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover;opacity:1;object-position:center" alt="Billie Joe Armstrong using the Major V headphones by Marshall in a cinema" width="4" height="5" srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=300&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 300w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=500&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=700&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 700w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=900&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 900w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1200w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1500&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1500w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=1900&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 1900w, //images.ctfassets.net/javen7msabdh/7l8cGhrjpQvZwzGSQlVecj/bb16eb0b72d1168c61595ed97a1be737/major_v_headband_reactivation_2025_single_asset_full_width_13_mobile.jpg?w=2400&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85 2400w" decoding="async" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto"/></picture></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="one-asset-widget css-1wxtiak"><div class="css-3lf2mu"><div class="css-ldo4d5"><div class="css-910he2"><div class="css-1ofqig9"><div class="css-q9gr9r"><div class="css-mc2adz"><iframe allowfullscreen="" data-ot-ignore="true" title="Vimeo video" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" loading="lazy" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/935346746?&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;background=0" style="width:100%;height:100%;transform:none;background-color:#000"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="6U19067GEI14h3S566Rpke" class="css-n6qyk2"><div class="css-98tlnd"><h2 class="chakra-text css-1vw7qil" style="text-wrap:pretty">MAKING THINGS LAST LONGER</h2></div><div class="css-1ohp4ne"><div class="css-nh7tjc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="font-family:NeueHelvetica, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:1.8rem;line-height:2.5rem;letter-spacing:0">Our in-app <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">battery preservation</strong> feature enables you to reduce how quickly your battery ages, so you can get more out of your headphones for longer. <strong style="color:#FFFFFF">86% of the plastic in Major V is recycled*</strong>, made from preloved products including used electronic devices and CDs, extending the lifecycle of these discarded items.

*33% of the product consists of plastic of which 86% is GRS certified post-consumer recycled plastic. Percentage breakdown is based on weight and excludes any plastic that can be found in electronical components due to the lack of detailed material knowledge in every component.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="css-1kp4odr"><div class="css-42el71"><h2 class="chakra-text css-1b8w4xi" style="text-wrap:pretty">PRODUCT DETAILS</h2></div><div class="css-fm6958"><div class="css-mljcy4"><p class="chakra-text css-w6rmp7">PLAY TIME</p><div class="css-1fc35gv"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap">100+ hours of wireless playtime</p></div></div></div><div class="css-mljcy4"><p class="chakra-text css-w6rmp7">CUSTOMISE SOUND</p><div class="css-1fc35gv"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap">Yes</p></div></div></div><div class="css-mljcy4"><p class="chakra-text css-w6rmp7">WIRELESS CHARGING</p><div class="css-1fc35gv"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap">Yes</p></div></div></div><div class="css-mljcy4"><p class="chakra-text css-w6rmp7">BLUETOOTH MULTIPOINT CONNECTIVITY</p><div class="css-1fc35gv"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap">Yes</p></div></div></div><div class="css-1ckn03k"><button type="button" class="chakra-button css-1x4z1qx">PRODUCT DETAILS</button></div></div></div><div id="12b5Rj39IhFJESPdg4Txy3" class="css-44d2x0"><div class="css-cfx72p"><h2 class="chakra-text css-15lxvnu">COMMON QUESTIONS</h2></div><div class="css-72nt16"><div class="css-1ofqig9"><div class="chakra-accordion css-ujikzk"><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:Rq6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:Rq6lcl9f95cnl:">How do I get started?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:Rq6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:Rq6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">I. Push and hold the Control knob until the LED turns to a slow blue pulse. </p></div><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">II. Select MAJOR V from your sound device’s Bluetooth® list. </p></div><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">III. Download the Marshall Bluetooth app and follow the in-app instructions to complete the setup.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R1a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R1a6lcl9f95cnl:">Do I need an app to use this product?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R1a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R1a6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">No, you can use Major V without an app, although the Marshall Bluetooth app gives you access to extra features, such as adjusting your personal EQ settings, customise the M-button and managing updates that keep your product up to date with our latest software.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R1q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R1q6lcl9f95cnl:">What kind of sound can I expect from this Major V?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R1q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R1q6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">Thunderous bass, smooth mids and crisp treble. Major V delivers the Marshall signature sound you know and love.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R2a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R2a6lcl9f95cnl:">I think cable sounds better, can I attach one?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R2a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R2a6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">Yes, we also include a 3.5mm cable.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R2q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R2q6lcl9f95cnl:">What&#x27;s the playtime of these headphones?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R2q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R2q6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">100+ hours of wireless playtime.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R3a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R3a6lcl9f95cnl:">Does Major V come with battery preservation feature?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R3a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R3a6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">Battery preservation can be activated in the Marshall Bluetooth app and makes it easy to charge the headphones consciously for a longer lasting experience. This will increase the life length of the battery. The battery preservation feature includes a 90% charge limit and regulates charging temperature and speed.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R3q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R3q6lcl9f95cnl:">Is Major V water-resistant? How much water will it withstand?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R3q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R3q6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">Major V is not IP rated, so don’t take them swimming.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R4a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R4a6lcl9f95cnl:">Can I replace the batteries when they are worn out?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R4a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R4a6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">Major V will be our first set of headphones to be included in our repair program. The batteries can be changed at Marshall&#x27;s authorised repair centres for a fee in many markets.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R4q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R4q6lcl9f95cnl:">What&#x27;s the benefit of having Bluetooth 5.3? Does it come with LE Audio?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R4q6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R4q6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">The main benefits of using the latest Bluetooth standard are connectivity and stability. This version supports LE Audio, meaning it’s ready for further improvements to the technology.</p></div></div></div><hr aria-orientation="horizontal" class="chakra-divider css-sx6hbr"/></div><div class="chakra-accordion__item css-1t7rcca"><button type="button" class="chakra-button chakra-accordion__button css-gtxjjt" style="color:#8C8C8C" id="accordion-button-:R5a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-panel-:R5a6lcl9f95cnl:">What sustainability aspects have you taken into consideration when producing this product?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false" class="chakra-icon css-1jlg0f"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="bevel" stroke-width="1.5" d="m13 6-5 5-5-5"></path></svg></button><div class="chakra-collapse" style="overflow:hidden;display:none;opacity:0;height:0px"><div role="region" id="accordion-panel-:R5a6lcl9f95cnl:" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-:R5a6lcl9f95cnl:" class="chakra-accordion__panel css-1w0s7xc"><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;color:#8C8C8C" class="css-0"><p style="margin-bottom:2.4rem;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#FFFFFF">We want everything we make to last longer. This means taking responsibility for our products throughout their lifecycle, improving features that will help prolong their lifespan, as well as using safe and responsibly sourced materials in both product and packaging design. Our efforts in this field are ongoing, but below are some examples of improvements to Major V:

We want you to enjoy your Marshall product for years to come, so we build our headphones and speakers to be rugged enough to withstand everyday wear and tear. We also design them with new features in mind so that you can get more out of them for longer. For example, Major V is ready for next generation Bluetooth LE Audio technology and you can download OTA updates so that your product always has the latest software. We also now offer an authorised repair services for Major V through our homepage. And if you ever need new ear cushions, just head over to the accessories and spare parts page to find them.

When switching to more responsible materials, we focus on recycled sources and better chemicals. 86% of the plastic in Major V is recycled*, made from preloved products including used electronic devices and CDs. Our iconic vegan leather has been replaced with a durable, water-based, and DMFa-free alternative that is safer for the people in production and the environment. Major V is also entirely PVC-free as PVC is considered one of the most harmful plastics.

Our packaging is designed to minimise its environmental impact by being optimised for transportation, minimising the plastic content and using materials from responsible sources. Major V’s packaging is 100% paper-based with a recycled content of 94%. We also use vegetable-based inks made from soybeans instead of traditional petroleum or oil-based inks.

